{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Expand. Rule the stars.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to My Colony, the ultimate sci-fi city builder and space empire simulation. Whether you\u2019re leading a peaceful outpost or an industrial powerhouse, the galaxy is yours to shape \u2014 one rover at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Colony</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a single lander and rover, gather resources, and unlock a massive tech tree full of structures, utilities, and special units. Every resource leads to new possibilities as you evolve from a basic outpost to a sprawling interplanetary empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Civilization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of four distinct factions, each with unique tech trees, units, and play styles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >United Earth \u2013 Balanced and tech-driven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >League of Independent States \u2013 Resource-efficient rebels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zolarg Empire \u2013 Insectoid swarm-style economics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alpha Draconians \u2013 Advanced reptilian overlords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-city sandbox or Premium Region Mode with connected cities across a shared map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Regions: Cooperate or compete with friends \u2014 each sub-city run by a different player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Declare independence from your \u201cmother colony\u201d and start your own empire \u2014 with players paying taxes to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form Federations with others to dominate galactic leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Galactic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in daily online challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade on the Galactic Board of Trade, a real-time player-run auction house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance population, GDP, education, security, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through the ranks as you scale your economy and influence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Anywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works offline or online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sync progress with your Ape Apps Account</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a living universe of colonists. Forge alliances. Grow your power. Leave your mark on the stars.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b67856670d96e0dce9d6ba391748a3a8a5707780.jpg","localized_name":"Independence","name":"Independence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/964130/b67856670d96e0dce9d6ba391748a3a8a5707780.jpg"},{"icon":"67a5e213e5d7226e533605a9fdff7db68795e603.jpg","localized_name":"Baby Colony","name":"Baby Colony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/964130/67a5e213e5d7226e533605a9fdff7db68795e603.jpg"},{"icon":"9e4d1608c017b06b2be8dc717e2557f58e898647.jpg","localized_name":"Galactic Trader","name":"Galactic Trader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/964130/9e4d1608c017b06b2be8dc717e2557f58e898647.jpg"},{"icon":"089dd4a2b988eab828a4520a44b500458ea5d5ba.jpg","localized_name":"Budding Colony","name":"Budding Colony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/964130/089dd4a2b988eab828a4520a44b500458ea5d5ba.jpg"},{"icon":"85b1a64c326bf211a0a08259ae3a9abf2f47ee61.jpg","localized_name":"Growing Civilization","name":"Growing Civilization","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/964130/85b1a64c326bf211a0a08259ae3a9abf2f47ee61.jpg"},{"icon":"466b6c502e0cb18d9ed79f1316669794cfafef8f.jpg","loca