ayers paying taxes to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form Federations with others to dominate galactic leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Galactic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in daily online challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade on the Galactic Board of Trade, a real-time player-run auction house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance population, GDP, education, security, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through the ranks as you scale your economy and influence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Anywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works offline or online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sync progress with your Ape Apps Account</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a living universe of colonists. Forge alliances. Grow your power. Leave your mark on the stars.</p>","developers":["Ape Apps"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Ape Apps Account (accounts.ape-apps.com) (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964130/2794f3470b793a75caf9bd34083e36659ecef227/header.jpg?t=1761252414","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.9<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:<